ind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #6: DEMO IS LIVE!","summary":"What’s up, nerds? The big day is here! The Demo for ScareZone: Haunted Attraction Tycoon is now live. There are far too many people to thank right now and far too much to still polish before Next Fest - so I won't get into that now. But it's live! Go build something horrific, share it with us on Discord - and if anything goes wrong that Report a Bug button is waiting for ya. Thanks for following our progress, more to come Soon!* * Soon™ is a registered trademark of Riot Games Studios, used witho","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T03:42:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706683748","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402490-1844115010490537","game_id":"steam-4402490","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #5: Playtesters are giving us LIFE","summary":"What’s up, nerds? Steam NextFest is creeping ever closer, and playtesters are having a BLAST creating some incredibly creative builds in ScareZone: Haunted Attraction Tycoon.We're knee-deep in bug fixes, and preparing to ship the demo but wanted to take a moment to share some of the amazing work of our playtesters:Thanks for sharing your work guys, seeing the game in your hands is bringing us back to LIFE after months of dev slog. More updates to come soon™* -Thoosie * Soon™ is a registered trad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T00:53:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402490-1842846814454340","game_id":"steam-4402490","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #4: Get ready for Playtesting!","summary":"What’s up, nerds? We've had a BUSY couple of months promoting and developing ScareZone: Haunted Attraction Tycoon. We attended Midsummer Scream in Long Beach, CA and got to meet tons of spooky people. Thanks to everyone who stopped by our table!We’re now collaborating with Dark Chord Audio Productions - an experienced sound designer for the haunt attraction industry.We're continuing to work with local attractions in the Central Florida area like Fear Reach Scream Park and Tales of Terror to reco","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T00:53:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454340","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402490-1836506165573371","game_id":"steam-4402490","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #3: We're going to GCX!","summary":"What’s up, nerds? Dropping in to share a quick dev log - tons of exciting stuff going on with ScareZone: Haunted Attraction Tycoon. We have partnered with HauntForm Studios - experts in scare actor and creature movement with decades of experience in haunting at all of your favorite attractions. We will be filming markerless motion capture with their signature performers later this week. We’ve also teamed up with the incredible spooky artist, Cole Cameron, to bring his unmistakable vintage hallow","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-05T01:38:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165573371","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402490-1833968530890375","game_id":"steam-4402490","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2: Spooky Empire!","summary":"What’s up, nerds? Pulling a bit of an all-nighter this evening as we prepare for the Spooky Empire convention (Fri-Sun: Hallway Booth - H5, say hi if you’re here) - this will be our first time revealing our game concept to the broader Halloween community and in our hometown of Orlando. Exciting times. I’ve got a great group of veteran scare actors who are helping with the booth, and we will be recording motion capture footage of cosplayers and attendees giving us their best SCARE. These performa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T08:16:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890375","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4402490-1831432155578584","game_id":"steam-4402490","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1: Welcome to ScareZone","summary":"What’s up, nerds?You can call me Thoosie. I’m really excited to introduce myself, Thoosie Labs, and our first project - ScareZone: Haunted Attraction Tycoon.ScareZone was born out of a deeply nerdy Sunday afternoon experiment; I’d recently learned the Godot platform for a work project and had just finished a rewatch of Defunctland’s incomparable Shapeland documentary. After a glass or two of wine, I built a very simple simulation of throughput in an HHN style walkthrough attraction and found mys","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T20:21:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155578584","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:05:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4402490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:29Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4402490":"2026-10-26T02:29:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4402490":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:29:29Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-